  "sn55.26:18.3": "Right knowledge and right freedom are normally only qualities of an arahant, but here they are ascribed to Anāthapiṇḍika though he is only a stream-enterer. See note on <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn45.26/en/sujato#2.2'>SN 45.26:2.2</a>. ",
